{"id":"memorial_101901","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101900","label":"Call Logs · Audio Portion of a Streamer's Live Stream"},"label":"BJ_01.mp4","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_101902","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101901_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"(The file is corrupted, and only the audio can be played.)"},{"id":"memorial_101901_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Hey, guys! How have you been? It's been a while since my last stream."},{"id":"memorial_101901_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"I'm good, but I'm not sure how things are going outside right now..."},{"id":"memorial_101901_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"I can't believe this is actually happening. It's like something straight out of a bad sci-fi movie!"},{"id":"memorial_101901_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"What are those aliens, anyway?"},{"id":"memorial_101901_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Thank you for the donation, LoneSurvivor!"},{"id":"memorial_101901_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"I'm looking at the comments,"},{"id":"memorial_101901_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"and it's good to know everyone's doing okay."},{"id":"memorial_101901_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"\"Take care of yourself.\"?"},{"id":"memorial_101901_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Don't worry, those aliens won't get rid of me so easily."},{"id":"memorial_101901_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Speaking of which, I feel like we could take 'em as long as we have the right weapons."},{"id":"memorial_101901_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Heck, I bet I could take on five of those suckers on my own!"},{"id":"memorial_101901_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"What do you guys think? That'd make for a crazy video."},{"id":"memorial_101901_14","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"I bet it'd blow up big time... so I'll have to think it over."},{"id":"memorial_101901_15","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"Anyway, I'll be live streaming tomorrow. See you guys then!"},{"id":"memorial_101901_16","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_01_description","text":"If you enjoyed this video, don't forget to like and subscribe!"}]}